# Route: guide 29 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 51 to
# 53, 26 quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Searing Gorge, Badlands): The Cauldron -> Firewatch Ridge -> The
# Cauldron -> Firewatch Ridge -> The Cauldron -> Firewatch Ridge -> The
# Cauldron -> Grimesilt Dig Site -> Firewatch Ridge -> The Cauldron ->
# Firewatch Ridge -> Kargath -> Camp Cagg -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Flame's Casing (3452; Twilight
# Dark Shaman 47-48, Twilight Fire Guard 48-49, Twilight Geomancer 49-50,
# Twilight Idolater 49-51); WANTED: Overseer Maltorius (7701; Overseer
# Maltorius 50); Broken Alliances (793; Blacklash 50, Hematus 50); Summoning
# the Princess (656; Myzrael 44).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 3379
# Shadoweaver; 3385 The Undermarket; 3402 The Undermarket.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Blackhand's Command (7761), The Left Piece of Lord
# Valthalak's Amulet (8966), The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8967),
# The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8968), The Left Piece of Lord
# Valthalak's Amulet (8969), The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet
# (8989), The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8990), The Right Piece
# of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8991), The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's
# Amulet (8992), Mea Culpa, Lord Valthalak (8995), Find the Gems and Power
# Source (2339), Disharmony of Fire (3907), Commander Gor'shak (3981), The
# Rise of the Machines (4063), KILL ON SIGHT: Dark Iron Dwarves (4081), KILL
